      "origin_anchor": "libs/langgraph/langgraph/graph/state.py#attach_edge",
      "title": "静态边如何变成 EphemeralValue 信标？",
      "concise_markdown": "`attach_edge(u, v)` 并未保存邻接表指针，而是注册通道 `branch:to:v`（`EphemeralValue`），并在 `u` 的 `ChannelWrite` 末尾追加写信标动作、将 `branch:to:v` 加入 `v.triggers`。",
      "heat_score": 24,
      "suggested_sparks": [
