      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "insight_ch01_reducer_order",
      "kind": "insight",
      "visibility": "crystallized_public",
      "chapter_id": "ch01_compile_magic",
      "origin_anchor": "libs/langgraph/langgraph/channels/binop.py#BinaryOperatorAggregate",
      "title": "并发追加列表时顺序是随机的吗？",
      "concise_markdown": "绝非随机！虽然节点 B、C 并发执行完成先后不定，但在 `_algo.py:apply_writes` 第 257 行会先按 `writes_sort_key(task.path)` 确定性排序任务，再喂给 `operator.add`，保证每次重放列表顺序 100% 一致。",
      "heat_score": 19,
      "suggested_sparks": [
        { "label": "如何绕过 operator.add 直接清空覆盖整个列表？", "dimension": "edge_case" }
      ]
    },
    {
