      "visibility": "crystallized_public",
      "chapter_id": "ch02_superstep_barrier",
      "origin_anchor": "libs/langgraph/langgraph/pregel/_algo.py#prepare_next_tasks",
      "title": "Ch.2 主干 · 超步唤醒与同步屏障",
      "concise_markdown": "`prepare_next_tasks` 比对 `channel_versions` 与 `versions_seen` 决定本轮并发任务；`apply_writes` 在超步末尾统一合入写入并推进版本号。",
      "heat_score": 38
    },
    {
      "id": "insight_ch02_fanin_barrier",
      "kind": "insight",
      "visibility": "crystallized_public",
      "chapter_id": "ch02_superstep_barrier",
      "origin_anchor": "libs/langgraph/langgraph/channels/named_barrier_value.py#NamedBarrierValue",
      "title": "扇入汇聚屏障：NamedBarrierValue",
      "concise_markdown": "`_triggers` 本身是逻辑或（`any`），但 `add_edge(['node_b', 'node_c'], 'node_d')` 编译出了专用 `NamedBarrierValue` 通道：只有当 `self.seen == self.names` 集齐双分支写入时 `is_available()` 才为真，精准阻塞提前唤醒。",
      "heat_score": 34,
      "suggested_sparks": [
        { "label": "如果分支 B 快、分支 C 慢（跨多个超步），D 会提前跑吗？", "dimension": "edge_case" },
        { "label": "循环图里 NamedBarrierValue 跑完一轮如何清零？", "dimension": "mechanism" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "insight_ch02_barrier_consume",
      "kind": "insight",
      "visibility": "crystallized_public",
      "chapter_id": "ch02_superstep_barrier",
      "origin_anchor": "libs/langgraph/langgraph/pregel/_algo.py#apply_writes",
      "title": "consume() 自清理保障循环图可重入",
      "concise_markdown": "在 `_algo.py:L292` 的 `apply_writes` 中，所有触发了本轮任务的通道都会执行 `channels[chan].consume()`。`NamedBarrierValue` 借此清空 `self.seen` 并递增版本，下一圈循环即可重新等待全集。",
      "heat_score": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "insight_ch02_read_isolation",
      "kind": "insight",
      "visibility": "crystallized_public",
      "chapter_id": "ch02_superstep_barrier",
      "origin_anchor": "libs/langgraph/langgraph/pregel/_algo.py#_proc_input",
      "title": "并发零锁秘诀：Plan 期快照拷贝 + 私有 deque",
      "concise_markdown": "并行节点 B、C 在 `Plan` 阶段由 `_proc_input` 读取冻结快照，在 `Execute` 阶段仅向各自 `PregelExecutableTask.writes` 私有 `deque` 追加写记录，全程不碰共享 `channels`，零互斥锁实现绝对读写隔离。",
      "heat_score": 27
    },
