      "origin_anchor": "libs/langgraph/langgraph/types.py#interrupt",
      "title": "Ch.4 主干 · GraphInterrupt 冒泡与重放对表",
      "concise_markdown": "`interrupt()` 利用异常冒泡中止当前超步并将挂起信息存入 `pending_writes`；恢复时从节点函数第 1 行重跑，靠 `PregelScratchpad` 序号计数器原地返回答案。",
      "heat_score": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "insight_ch04_multi_interrupt",
      "kind": "insight",
      "visibility": "crystallized_public",
      "chapter_id": "ch04_interrupt_replay",
      "origin_anchor": "libs/langgraph/langgraph/_internal/_scratchpad.py#PregelScratchpad",
      "title": "同一节点连续调用两次 interrupt() 怎么区分？",
      "concise_markdown": "`PregelScratchpad.interrupt_counter` 是一个从 0 递增的原子计数器：第 2 次恢复重跑时，第 1 个 `interrupt()` 拿到 `idx=0` 立即返回 `resume[0]` 旧值，走到第 2 个 `interrupt()` 拿到 `idx=1` 才消费新传入的恢复值！",
      "heat_score": 29,
      "suggested_sparks": [
        { "label": "如果在重放时用随机 if 分支改变了 interrupt 调用顺序会怎样？", "dimension": "edge_case" }
      ]
    },
