      "chapter_id": "ch05_checkpoint_timetravel",
      "origin_anchor": "libs/checkpoint/langgraph/checkpoint/base/__init__.py#CheckpointTuple",
      "title": "Ch.5 主干 · CheckpointTuple 不可变时间树",
      "concise_markdown": "通过单调 UUIDv6 `id` 与 `parent_config` 构建不可变状态树，`update_state` 通过派生新分支快照实现零破坏时间分叉（Fork）。",
      "heat_score": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "insight_ch05_fork_mechanics",
      "kind": "insight",
      "visibility": "crystallized_public",
      "chapter_id": "ch05_checkpoint_timetravel",
      "origin_anchor": "libs/langgraph/langgraph/pregel/_loop.py#_first",
      "title": "为什么 Fork 后上游节点不会重新跑一遍？",
      "concise_markdown": "因为分叉快照完整继承了历史时间点的 `versions_seen` 账本！上游节点已见版本等于通道版本，只有 `as_node` 刚递增的那条下游边通道版本大于下游节点的 `versions_seen`，因此引擎精准只唤醒下游分支。",
      "heat_score": 23
    },
