      "title": "Ch.6 主干 · 子图嵌套与 checkpoint_ns 命名空间",
      "concise_markdown": "编译子图作为 `Runnable` 在父任务上下文中启动独立 `SyncPregelLoop`，通过 `parent_node:task_id` 命名空间隔离存储并共享流式回调。",
      "heat_score": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "insight_ch06_sub_interrupt",
      "kind": "insight",
      "visibility": "crystallized_public",
      "chapter_id": "ch06_subgraph_streaming",
      "origin_anchor": "libs/langgraph/langgraph/pregel/_loop.py#_first",
      "title": "子图内部调了 interrupt()，父图怎么感知并恢复？",
      "concise_markdown": "`GraphInterrupt` 会穿透子图循环一路冒泡至父图任务捕获，同时子图在自身 `checkpoint_ns` 下保存进度；恢复时父图设置 `CONFIG_KEY_RESUMING` 标志重入子图命名空间，精准接续子图断点。",
      "heat_score": 20
    }
